  "description": "Your own space in the heart of Dublin 8.\n18 Newmarket Square combines contemporary city living with the character and energy of The Liberties, one of Dublin’s oldest neighbourhoods. \n\nSpacious, fully furnished A-rated apartments feature modern open-plan living, excellent storage and a private balcony with every home, giving residents valuable outdoor space in the heart of the city. \n\nBeyond your apartment, residents have access to a dedicated gym and wellness centre, landscaped rooftop terraces, co-working space, residents' lounge, TV room and games room, alongside high-speed Wi-Fi, bike storage and parcel collection.\n\nCity living on your doorstep\nLocated in Dublin 8, 18 Newmarket Square puts some of the city's best-known neighbourhoods and attractions within easy reach, with cafés, restaurants, distilleries and cultural destinations throughout the surrounding Liberties. Christ Church Cathedral, the Guinness Storehouse and St Stephen's Green are all within easy reach, alongside public transport connections into and across the city.\n\nReady to make 18 Newmarket Square home? Book your viewing today.",
