  "description": "Discover Luxury Living in the Heart of Sandyford\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing please visit www.carmanhallplace.ie\n\nCarmanhall Place is a premium new residential destination in the heart of Sandyford, thoughtfully designed to bring together exceptional architecture, modern convenience and a vibrant sense of community. Comprising 428 apartments across a range of carefully curated layouts, this striking development combines elegant contemporary design with best-in-class amenities and outstanding connectivity.\n\nDefined by its distinctive architectural profile, attractive light stone and glass façade, and beautifully landscaped communal spaces, Carmanhall Place has been designed to maximise natural light, outdoor living and panoramic views. Residents will enjoy an exceptional range of on-site facilities, including concierge service, co-working spaces, rooftop gardens, landscaped courtyards, EV charging facilities and a dedicated post room. A pet-friendly environment, complete with a complimentary self-service dog wash station, ensures every member of the household feels at home.\n\nFuture phases will further enhance the community with the addition of a residents’ gym, crèche and playground, creating a truly integrated lifestyle destination in one of Dublin’s most sought-after residential and business locations.\n\nThe apartments at Carmanhall Place have been carefully crafted to deliver an unrivalled combination of style, comfort and sustainability. Offering a diverse mix of studio, one-bedroom, two-bedroom, two-bedroom duplex and three-bedroom homes, every residence has been designed to meet the needs of modern lifestyles.\n\nEach apartment is fully furnished with premium-quality furniture and fitted with integrated Bosch appliances throughout, creating elegant and functional living spaces from day one. Floor-to-ceiling glazing maximises natural light and frames impressive city and mountain views, while generous private balconies and terraces provide valuable outdoor living space.\n\nEvery home achieves an A0 energy rating and benefits from best-in-class exhaust air heat pump technology, delivering exceptional energy efficiency, lower running costs and superior year-round comfort. High-speed fibre connectivity is available throughout, with co-working spaces providing seamless connectivity, streaming and everyday living.\n\n*Please note: \n1) The rent displayed on individual listings represents the starting price for that property category. Rental rates vary depending on the specific unit, location, floor level, and layout. Not all available apartments or rental values may be advertised online; our team can provide details of current availability during viewings. \n2) The images shown feature our show apartments and are intended for illustrative purposes only. A variety of apartment types are available throughout the development, and while individual homes may differ in layout, aspect, and size, the imagery reflects the high standard of design, specification, and finish delivered across the scheme.\n3) Residents' amenities may become available on a phased basis and could open after move-in dates. Access to these facilities is subject to the overall construction and delivery schedule of the development.",
